            "citation":"The union of the Who's On First region records Kraslavas (85685833), Aglonas (85685855), Dagdas (85685893). Each former municipality is assigned to the municipality that GeoNames files most of the populated places inside its boundary under, counted on 2026-11-26. Stren\u010di, Rauna and Varak\u013c\u0101ni are assigned as the law's annex lists them. The former Aglona municipality (85685855) was divided: the annex lists Aglona parish under Prei\u013ci municipality and Gr\u0101veri, Kastu\u013cina and \u0160\u0137eltova under Kr\u0101slava. GeoNames files 58% of the populated places inside the record under Kr\u0101slava.",
            "property":"geometry"
        }
